{"item_uid": "指考96-chemistry-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔78分）", "stem": "圖 3 為一個容器內的液體與其蒸氣所形成平衡系統的示\n活塞\n意圖。在定溫下，將活塞緩慢往上拉，整個過程中，一直\n蒸氣\n使系統處於平衡狀態，當系統的體積達到 V時，液體全部\n1 液體\n消失。試問下列哪一個最能表示此系統的壓力隨體積變化\n圖3\n的關係圖？", "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": "", "E": "P P P P\nP\nV V V V V V V 1 V V 1 V\n1 1 1"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 48.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 20.0, "E": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 80.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 34.0, "E": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 48.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 58.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 63.0, 41.0, 29.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-chemistry-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔78分）", "stem": "有甲、乙、丙、丁、戊、己、庚等七杯各含 100 毫升濃度不等的鹽酸溶液，\n各溶液的 pH 值分別為 7.0、6.0、5.0、4.0、3.0、2.0、1.0。今將濃鹽酸逐滴\n滴入各溶液中，使各溶液的 pH 值，分別降為 6.0、5.0、4.0、3.0、2.0、1.0、\n0.0。若用各溶液所需加入濃鹽酸的滴數對各溶液的編號作圖，則所形成的曲\n線，應接近下列哪一個？", "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": "", "E": ""}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 47.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 5.0, "E": 11.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 68.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 2.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 11.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 68.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 54.0, 46.0, 37.0, 23.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考96-chemistry-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 96, "year_ce": 2007, "subject_key": "chemistry", "subject_zh": "化學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（佔78分）", "stem": "圖4為氫原子結合成氫分子的位能變化圖。當二個氫原子逐漸接近時，電子與\n原子核相互吸引，導致其位能逐漸降低，直至位能最低時\n(－432kJ/mol)，形成最穩定的氫分子。(氫分子的鍵能即為\n432kJ/mol，而此時氫原子核間的距離(0.74埃)，即為氫分\n子的鍵長)。當二個氫原子更接近時，因原子核間的斥力大\n增，其位能亦急速增高。下列有關 Cl 、 Br 、 I 等分子形成\n2 2 2 圖4\n過程中，位能變化的相對關係圖，何者正確？", "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": "", "E": "- 3 -\n96年指考 第 4 頁\n化學考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 51.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 2.0, "E": 82.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 23.0}, "omit_rate": 20.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 59.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 68.0, 49.0, 34.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
